//! What the form's operations on containers hold beyond their operands.

import layout (Intrinsic)

/// An operation on a container's cells, written in place over the objects the runtime lays out.
/// An item an operation reads or writes is a word in the object; its value is held as the operand
/// or answer that holds it.
pub type ContainerOp =
  /// An extern `layout.ply` declares over a list's or a map's nodes.
  | Laid(Intrinsic)
  /// How many items a list holds, or bytes a byte string, read off its header.
  | Length
  /// How many elements an array holds, its words counted a stride at a time.
  | Elements
  /// Byte `i` of a byte string, tested against its length.
  | ByteAt
  /// The four bytes from `i` of a byte string as a little-endian `U32`, tested against its length.
  | U32At
  /// Byte strings joined, without the list of them made.
  | Joined
